can be trained to ignore the video recorder.\n  .\n- **B) Golf instructors do not know how to properly use video technology**: This option is not supported by the context.The context does not discuss the instructors\' proficiency with video technology.It only mentions that they are using videotaped sessions to help their students.Video is a reliable tool for accurately diagnosing a golf swing.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
