 intelligence between women and men.This aligns with the statement in Option A.\n  .\n- **Option B: Women are good at handling all kinds of personnel relations**.\n  - The context mentions that women have natural advantages in communication skills and affinity, which can be interpreted as being good at handling personnel relations.This aligns with the statement in Option B.\n  .\n- **Option C: Women are suitable for management**.The information age is not more suitable for giving full play to women's advantages.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
