ugar, some sweet lovers have sleep disorders.**.\n   - This option introduces a potential negative health consequence of reducing sugar intake, but it does not address the sales data or the relationship between public awareness and sales.It does not weaken the conclusion.In recent years, the price of white sugar has plummeted due to a sharp increase in the area of sugarcane planting.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
