messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe term boundary problem refers to various short-sighted behaviors of employees due to the short employment relationship in modern enterprises, and the harm caused by such behaviors to the enterprise\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings belongs to the term boundary problem\n# Options:\nA) Because he will retire in one year, lao zhao feels unable and his work efficiency is getting worse and worse\nB) Because he was not familiar with the business, xiao li, who had just come a month, lost a big customer and the company lost a lot\nC) Because he felt that it was impossible to become a regular worker,xiao wang worked hard every day to show himself \nD) Because he only signed a contract for half a year, xiao sun ignored the use of working machinery and equipment', 'To solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the context and analyze each option in relation to the term "boundary problem.".\n\n### Context Recap:.\n- **Boundary Problem**: Short-sighted behaviors of employees due to the short employment relationship in modern enterprises.\n- **Harm**: The harm caused by such behaviors to the enterprise.\n\n### Analyzing Each Option:.\n\n**A) Because he will retire in one year, lao zhao feels unable and his work efficiency is getting worse and worse.**.\n- **Analysis**: This option suggests that lao zhao\'s work efficiency is declining because he feels he has a short time left in the job.This could be a sign of short-sighted behavior, but it doesn\'t necessarily indicate a short-term behavior due to the short-term nature of his employment.Retirement is a long-term event, not a short-term one.\n\n**B) Because he was not familiar with the business, xiao li, who had just come a month, lost a big customer and the company lost a lot.**.\n- **Analysis**: Xiao Li lost a big customer due to unfamiliarity with the business.This is a short-term issue related to his short-term employment, but it doesn\'t necessarily indicate a short-sighted behavior.It\'s more about inexperience.\nDue to Xiao Sun\'s long-term commitment, he diligently utilized working machinery and equipment, contrary to Xiao Wang\'s short-sighted behavior of neglecting them.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
