$200,000 = US $1,200,000.\n     - Total after 2 years: US $1,000,000 + US $1,200,000 = US $2,200,000.\n\n### Comparison:.\n- Huizhong Company after 2 years: US $1,050,000.David will not go to Kantuo because he will not have an extra $700,000 after two years, which is not the correct choice.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
